msgid "Found a <strong>bug</strong> in Weblate?"
msgstr "Märkasid Weblate <strong>viga</strong>?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"In case it is sensitive or a <strong>security issue</strong>, please report "
"it to %(report)s. Other ways of reporting security issue can be found in the "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Juhul kui tegu on tundliku või <strong>turvalisus vaidega</strong>, palun "
"teata sellest %(report)s. Teisi viise turvalisus vaide teavitamiseks võib "
"leida <a href=\"%(url)s\">dokumentatsioonist</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Ensure the bug is not already reported</strong>, by searching "
"through the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Veendu, et veast pole juba varem teavitatud</strong>, sirvides läbi "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub'i veateated</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you're unable to find an open issue addressing the problem, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">open a new one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kui sa ei leia avatud teavitust, mis sellele probleemile suunatud, siis <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">ava uus</a>."

msgid ""
"<strong>Follow instructions in the issue template</strong>, and provide as "
"much relevant info as possible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Järgi teavitamise malli juhiseid</strong>, ning paku võimalikult "
"palju asjakohast teavet."

